section.nuo-comments(data-nuo-comments data-api=theme.nuo_comments.api aria-label='评论')
  .nuo-comments-heading
    h2 评论
      span.nuo-comments-count(data-comments-count)
    a.nuo-comments-admin-link(href='/comments-admin/' hidden data-comments-admin-link) 管理评论
  .nuo-comments-assistant(data-comments-assistant hidden)
    img(src='/images/dafeiyu.png' width='28' height='28' alt='')
    div
      strong 大肥鱼
      span 读一遍本文与公开评论，帮你理清重点。
    button(type='button' data-comments-summary) 总结本文与评论
  form.nuo-comments-form(data-comments-form)
    .nuo-composer-top
      .nuo-comments-person
        span.nuo-comment-avatar(data-comments-avatar aria-hidden='true') 访
        .nuo-comments-person-copy
          strong(data-comments-identity) 登录后加入讨论
          span(data-comments-identity-hint) 用你的账号，留下一点想法。
      button.nuo-comments-login(type='button' data-comments-login) 登录 / 注册
    .nuo-comments-reply(hidden data-comments-reply-box)
      span(data-comments-reply)
      button(type='button' hidden data-comments-cancel aria-label='取消回复') 取消回复
    label.nuo-comments-sr-only(for='nuo-comment-body') 留下你的想法
    textarea#nuo-comment-body(name='comment' rows='3' maxlength='2000' placeholder='聊聊你的想法，或补充一条信息…' required disabled data-comments-body)
    .nuo-composer-bottom
      small.nuo-comments-review-note DeepSeek 辅助审核 · 发布后显示 IP 属地
      .nuo-comments-send
        span.nuo-comments-counter(data-comments-counter aria-live='off') 0 / 2000
        button(type='submit' disabled data-comments-submit)
          span 发表评论
          svg(width='15' height='15' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.7' aria-hidden='true')
            path(d='m5 12 14-7-5 14-2-7-7 0Z' stroke-linejoin='round')
            path(d='m12 12 7-7')
  p.nuo-comments-status(data-comments-status role='status' aria-live='polite') 正在加载评论…
  .nuo-comments-list(data-comments-list)
  button.nuo-comments-more(type='button' hidden data-comments-more) 加载更多
